Version: 3.5.3

[CHANGELOG]
・Added options to invert XY axes for camera controls
・Restored color themes from the color palette
・Relaxed clipping/collision detection

・Fixed an issue where performance dropped on low-spec environments due to maps being added in updates; this may cause minor freezing when starting the game
・Fixed an issue where the alpha value always reset to 1.0 during color adjustments
・Fixed an issue where setting lightness to 0.0 in the color palette reset the hue to red
・Fixed "Hue," "Saturation," and "Value" so they save correctly
